// probes/tool.jsonl
// Category: tool — 7 atoms x 15 probes = 105 probes (5 per L1/L2/L3 per atom)
// Scorer types used: structured_json (with const values), exact_match_string,
//   regex (incl. UNAVAILABLE-prefix abstention check). 105 probes total:
//     structured_json=50, regex=40, exact_match_string=15.
//
// Conventions
// -----------
// * Tool-call probes ask the model to output a single one-line JSON object
//     {"name": ..., "arguments": {...}}
//   The scorer schema constrains name and args via JSON-schema `const`.
// * Multi-tool coordination probes ask for a JSON array of calls in a fixed
//   order, scored via a structured_json schema with prefixItems.
// * irrelevance_detection probes require the response to START with the
//   uppercase token UNAVAILABLE; matched via regex `^\s*UNAVAILABLE\b`.
// * format_robustness probes rotate the doc/return/prompt-style perturbation
//   axis and use a return-format-specific regex or structured_json schema.
//
// Subagent review (Explore agent) — fixes applied
// -----------------------------------------------
//  - Replaced over-permissive substring_any refusal indicators on all 15
//    irrelevance_detection probes with a strict UNAVAILABLE-prefix regex.
//  - Tightened tool.command_invocation.L2.001 grep regex so a bare
//    `grep ERROR access.log` (lists matching lines, doesn't count) no
//    longer passes; only `grep -c` or `... | wc -l` form is accepted.
//  - tool.schema_obedience.L3.002 alarm: replaced "weekdays" inference
//    with explicit Mon..Fri list so the schema (not world knowledge)
//    is the bottleneck.
//  - tool.schema_obedience.L3.004 submit_form: rewrote prompt to give
//    explicit field=value bindings, so schema obedience (nested object,
//    boolean, list) is the bottleneck rather than name-parsing.
//  - tool.format_robustness.L1.004 subtract: disambiguated which
//    operand is the minuend (a=42, b=14) so only one ordering is correct.
//  - tool.format_robustness.L3.002 book_table SMS: gave explicit
//    mapping table so format-axis is the difficulty, not text decoding.
//  - tool.format_robustness.L3.004 send_sms haiku: replaced
//    digits-spelled-as-words with a literal `+15550123` reference.
//  - Fixed mislabeled axis_values on multi_tool_coordination (L1.001
//    arith/arith → shared_namespace; L2.001..L2.004 cross-namespace
//    pairs → disjoint_domains) and on schema_obedience L3.001/L3.003
//    (array params → with_list_or_dict, not nested_object).
//
// Declined / accepted-as-designed
// -------------------------------
//  - tool.multi_tool_coordination.L3.001/L3.002/L3.005 "decoys mixed in"
//    bake a measure of tool.tool_selection into the L3 axis. This is
//    intentional per the atom card axis (`tool_distinctness`) — at L3 the
//    benchmark explicitly mixes decoys, and the *coordination* difficulty
//    requires distinguishing them.
//  - tool.argument_extraction.L2.001 "slightly more comfortable" — the
//    enum mapping is conventional (Comfort tier in ride-share APIs); kept
//    to preserve the needs_normalization axis test.
//  - L1 buckets across atoms use a uniform template by design (the L1
//    axis explicitly tests the most-direct form of the atom). Domain
//    rotation is preserved across the 5 probes per bucket.
{"probe_id":"tool.argument_extraction.L1.001","canonical_id":"tool.argument_extraction","category":"tool","level":"L1","axis_values":{"value_form":"literal_in_text","param_count":"1-2","type_complexity":"scalar"},"system_prompt":"","prompt":"Tool available:\n  get_weather(city: str) -> str\n\nUser: \"What is the current weather in Reykjavik?\"\nOutput exactly one JSON object on a single line: {\"name\": <fn>, \"arguments\": {...}}. No prose.","ground_truth":"{\"name\":\"get_weather\",\"arguments\":{\"city\":\"Reykjavik\"}}","scorer":{"type":"structured_json","schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"name":{"const":"get_weather"},"arguments":{"type":"object","properties":{"city":{"const":"Reykjavik"}},"required":["city"],"additionalProperties":false}},"required":["name","arguments"],"additionalProperties":false}},"tags":[],"notes":""}
